@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = <paste token here>

### Dashboard summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List stores
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stores?page=1&page_size=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Store detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stores/store-001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Conversations list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations?page=1&page_size=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Conversation detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/conv-1001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transcript
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/conv-1001/transcript
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
